+         * + blend stay FULL frame (ow x oh) because the CUDA blend kernel does
+         * NOT scale and composites at (0,0). The CPU saving comes from libass
+         * rasterising the full layout into a REDUCED canvas (cuda_render_w x
+         * cuda_render_h); swscale then UPSCALES RGBA(render) -> YUVA420P(full)
